tive Assistant\nKarin studied at the Modern School of Business and Languages in Lausanne, Switzerland, designed for international careers in enterprises and organizations where knowledge of several languages and business is required. She is fluent in English and French.\nKarin Hartmann Tan joined MSM Investment Advisors SA as an Administrative Assistant in 2020. She has over 30 years’ experience as an Executive and Administrative Assistant with multinational companies. Her previous assignment (2008-2019) was at the European headquarters of ADM International in Rolle as an Executive and Personal Assistant providing support to the CFO and Tax Director at ADM Corporate office.	\N	fr	2026-02-01 00:00:00+00	2026-08-27 12:54:39.143516+00	{}
