ctions.\nThis international exposure helps Point5 maintain a practical understanding of financial systems, regulatory developments, geopolitical trends, and the institutional dynamics affecting internationally exposed families and entrepreneurs.\nFounex, Switzerland\nPoint5 Family Office, Switzerland\nREG: IDE/UID CHE-304.059.063\nGrand Rue 19\n1297 Founex, SWITZERLAND\njclara@point5familyoffice.com\n+4178 851 2772	\N	fr	2026-01-01 00:00:00+00	2026-08-27 12:54:44.323012+00	{}
